description	"B1 'Assault' Battledroid

^2Weapons:
- E-5 Blaster Rifle (2)
- E-60R Rocket Launcher (3 Rockets)
- 1 Thermal Detonator

^8Attributes:
- Blast Armour
- Battery Recharge (3)
- Close Combat Training (1)
- 1 Reinforcement
- Assemble (1)

^3Abilities:
- Gun Kick ^3[CS3]

A Battledroid of the Trade Federation, now part of the huge droid army being assembled for the CIS. Easy to take down, but but in groups much more deadly. The Assault battle droid is a red colored Battle droid armed with a Rocket Launcher and deadly explosives."